msgid "Block clicks"
msgstr "منع النقر"

msgid "Clicks and scrolling stop. The pointer still moves."
msgstr "يتوقف النقر والتمرير. يبقى المؤشر يتحرك."

msgid "Freeze it"
msgstr "تجميده"

msgid "Clicks, scrolling and the pointer stop."
